    <briefdescription>
<para>Imports EPK process models from ARIS Markup Language (AML) XML. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Handles the <computeroutput>&lt;AML&gt;</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>&lt;Group&gt;</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>&lt;Model&gt;</computeroutput> hierarchy produced by ARIS Designer 9.x and 10.x export. Uses the same hand-written, regex-free XML tokenizer strategy as <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_bpmn_serializer" kindref="compound">BpmnSerializer</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
